## Initial Audit (2026-05-08)

### What was found
- **Backend ~90% complete**: Express server, JSONL job storage, Claude executor (spawn-based), poll-driven queue manager, SSE broadcasting, REST API (jobs CRUD, queue pause/resume), HTML/CSS shell
