### Backend architecture summary
- `src/config.ts` — env-based configuration
- `src/errors.ts` — AppError hierarchy (NotFound, Validation, Conflict)
- `src/logger.ts` — colored console logger
- `src/server.ts` — Express app, wires everything, serves static + API + SSE
- `src/executor/claude.ts` — spawns `claude -p "prompt"` with timeout support
- `src/executor/types.ts` — ExecutorInput/Output interfaces
- `src/queue/manager.ts` — EventEmitter-based poll loop, processes jobs one at a time with retry/backoff
- `src/queue/sse.ts` — SSE client registry, broadcasts job events and stats
- `src/queue/types.ts` — Job, QueueStats, JobCreateInput, JobLog interfaces
- `src/storage/jobs.ts` — JSONL file store (append + atomic rewrite for updates)
- `src/storage/logs.ts` — per-job .log files
- `src/api/router.ts` — mounts /api/jobs and /api/queue sub-routers
- `src/api/jobs.ts` — GET/POST/DELETE jobs, cancel, retry, log
- `src/api/queue.ts` — GET status, POST pause/resume
- `src/web/index.html` — SPA shell with topbar nav, modal placeholder, toast
- `src/web/styles.css` — dark theme CSS (GitHub-inspired)

## Phase 1 — MVP Complete (2026-05-08)

### Completed
- Created `src/web/app.js` — full vanilla JS SPA frontend:
  - SSE real-time event handling
