## Reflection & Improvement Session (2026-05-08)

### Phase 1 — Reconstruction

**What was completed:**
- Full MVP backend + frontend (Express, vanilla JS SPA, SSE)
- 51 tests (16 smoke + 35 Playwright) — all passing
- 5 HIGH + 5 MEDIUM audit fixes applied
- Dead code removed, error handling unified, race condition fixed

**What failed/required rework:**
- Smoke test: 3 iterations to get working (port env var, SSE timeout, cancel timing)
- Playwright tests: 2 iterations (ordering dependency, empty-state assumption)
- JSONL writeAll race condition found and fixed (shared .tmp → uuid-based)

**Time wasted on:**
- Port issues in smoke test (server ignored CLI port, needed env var)
- SSE curl hanging (needed --max-time)
- Test ordering debugging (shared jobId variable)

### Phase 2 — Error Reflection

| # | Mistake | Avoidance |
|---|---------|-----------|
| 1 | Smoke test didn't pass PORT via env | Always check how config is loaded before writing scripts |
| 2 | SSE curl had no timeout | Add `--max-time` to any SSE/long-poll curl |
| 3 | Smoke test cancel raced with queue poll | Pause queue before testing cancel in scripts |
| 4 | API tests shared mutable variable | Use `describe` + `beforeEach` for isolated state |
| 5 | UI tests assumed empty queue | Use `.or()` matcher or don't assume empty state |
| 6 | `writeAll` used shared `.tmp` file | Use unique temp filenames (uuid) for atomic writes |
| 7 | No CLAUDE.md existed | Always create project instruction file for agent context |
| 8 | New `prompt.ts` threw raw Error | Enforce AppError convention project-wide |
| 9 | No tests for new `prompt.ts` endpoint | Add tests with every new endpoint |
| 10 | Prompt improvement tests call real Claude (slow) | Consider executor mocking for faster test runs |

